*.log
# ...except the committed test fixtures. tests/fixtures/zanbil/days/*.log is
# INPUT to the leakage guards in tests/test_dataset_integrity.py, which build a
# dataset from it at test time. Without this negation `*.log` silently drops
# them from `git add`, the labels commit without the logs they describe, and
# every matrix job fails on a fixture that works perfectly on the machine that
# generated it.
!tests/fixtures/**/*.log
